[en.DECISION_C02_PRAISE_OCTAVIA]
Commendation to Octavia

[en.DECISION_C02_PRAISE_OCTAVIA_desc]
This will increase Octavia’s support among the competitors, and can be used as a tool to weaken other competitors.

